---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-start">
      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="flex-1">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-golden-600 dark:text-golden-400 mb-3" data-animate>
          About
        </p>
        <h2
          id="about-heading"
          class="section-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#2C1A0F] dark:text-[#F0EBD8] mb-6"
          data-animate data-animate-delay="100"
        >
          Bridging Software Engineering<br class="hidden sm:block" /> and Computational Biology
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-[#7A5E48] dark:text-[#C0A87A] leading-relaxed" data-animate data-animate-delay="200">
          <p>
            I am a CSE graduate from Rajshahi University of Engineering &amp; Technology (RUET) who
            transitioned into computational biology research, driven by the conviction that rigorous
            software engineering can accelerate biological discovery. Since November 2023 I have been
            working as a Research Assistant in the Bioinformatics Lab (Dry) at the University of
            Rajshahi's Department of Statistics, where I design and implement bioinformatics
            pipelines, R packages, and web-based platforms that integrate multi-omics data — spanning
            genomics, transcriptomics, proteomics, and metagenomics — to identify therapeutic
            candidates.
          </p>
          <p>
            My current research centers on disease co-morbidity and co-infection key-gene discovery:
            uncovering the shared molecular mechanisms that link conditions such as dengue/SARS-CoV-2
            co-infection, type-2 diabetes and myocardial infarction, and cancer comorbidities with
            metabolic disease. This work feeds directly into biomarker identification, PPI network
            analysis, molecular docking, and drug repurposing pipelines. I am actively seeking a
            PhD position where I can deepen this integrative approach and contribute to a
            computationally-driven understanding of complex diseases.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick stats -->
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4" data-animate data-animate-delay="300">
          {[
            { value: '7+', label: 'Peer-reviewed\npublications' },
            { value: '2+', label: 'Years research\nexperience' },
            { value: '4', label: 'Journals under\nreview' },
          ].map(stat => (
            <div class="text-center p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#FAEDCD] dark:bg-[#251E14] border border-[#DFD0B5] dark:border-[#3D3020]">
              <div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-golden-600 dark:text-golden-400">{stat.value}</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[#9A7A60] dark:text-[#9A7A60] mt-1 whitespace-pre-line leading-tight">{stat.label}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Details card -->
      <div class="md:w-64 shrink-0" data-animate data-animate-delay="200">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#DFD0B5] dark:border-[#3D3020] bg-[#FAEDCD] dark:bg-[#251E14] p-6 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-[#2C1A0F] dark:text-[#F0EBD8] text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Quick Info</h3>
          {[
            { icon: 'location', label: 'Rajshahi, Bangladesh' },
            { icon: 'study', label: 'B.Sc. CSE, RUET (2024)' },
            { icon: 'lab', label: 'Bioinformatics Lab (Dry), Rajshahi University' },
            { icon: 'focus', label: 'Multi-omics · Drug Repurposing · Biomarker Discovery' },
          ].map(item => (
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-[#7A5E48] dark:text-[#C0A87A]">
              <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-golden-500" aria-hidden="true">
                {item.icon === 'location' && (
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
                )}
                {item.icon === 'study' && (
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z"/></svg>
                )}
                {item.icon === 'lab' && (
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"/></svg>
                )}
                {item.icon === 'focus' && (
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
                )}
              </span>
              <span>{item.label}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
